WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:17.256
Theo: Let's do something different at our meeting today.

2
00:00:17.257 --> 00:00:19.023
Sarah: Like what?

3
00:00:19.024 --> 00:00:22.238
Skyler: Let's find a mystery to solve with our pets.

4
00:00:22.239 --> 00:00:28.468
Theo: Or explore a spooky, old house.

5
00:00:28.469 --> 00:00:31.485
Riley: Our attic is kind of spooky.

6
00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:33.509
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

7
00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.138
Riley: Snooks doesn't like the attic.

8
00:00:36.139 --> 00:00:40.240
The dust makes him sneeze.

9
00:00:40.241 --> 00:00:42.692
Skyler: The attic sounds like fun.

10
00:00:42.693 --> 00:00:46.580
Riley: I think I saw an old birdcage up there.

11
00:00:46.581 --> 00:00:49.223
And it was all gold!

12
00:00:49.224 --> 00:00:53.285
Skyler: A gold birdcage? Cool!

13
00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:56.998
Riley: Well, it looked like gold anyway.

14
00:00:56.999 --> 00:00:58.672
Chatter: Oh boy!

15
00:00:58.673 --> 00:01:01.925
Theo: Let's go up!

16
00:01:01.926 --> 00:01:04.904
Riley: Mom, can we?

17
00:01:04.905 --> 00:01:08.771
Mrs. Summers: All right. But be sure to turn on the light.

18
00:01:08.772 --> 00:01:17.286
Mrs. Summers: And be careful on the stairs.

19
00:01:17.287 --> 00:01:21.377
Theo: Wow, it's neat up here.

20
00:01:21.378 --> 00:01:24.472
Snooks: Ah-choo!

21
00:01:24.473 --> 00:01:28.113
Ben: You can see all the way to school.

22
00:01:28.114 --> 00:01:31.033
Riley: Here's the gold birdcage!

23
00:01:31.034 --> 00:01:34.597
Skyler: Chatter loves bright, shiny objects.

24
00:01:34.598 --> 00:01:37.201
Chatter: Pretty!

25
00:01:37.202 --> 00:01:40.496
Theo: Look at this old trunk!

26
00:01:40.497 --> 00:01:44.398
Riley: It has all my Halloween costumes in it.

27
00:01:44.399 --> 00:01:46.461
Ben: I remember this from first grade.

28
00:01:46.462 --> 00:01:50.868
You dressed up as a frog.

29
00:01:50.869 --> 00:01:54.675
Theo: Look, Frankie, a frog costume!

30
00:01:54.676 --> 00:01:58.354
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

31
00:01:58.355 --> 00:02:01.479
Theo: Hey, Frankie, come back!

32
00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:05.777
Sarah: He likes the frog costume.

33
00:02:05.778 --> 00:02:08.655
Snooks: Woof! Woof!

34
00:02:08.656 --> 00:02:16.421
Riley: Snooks, now see what you did!

35
00:02:16.422 --> 00:02:18.661
Theo: The trunk is locked.

36
00:02:18.662 --> 00:02:21.463
Riley, where is the key?

37
00:02:21.464 --> 00:02:24.828
Riley: Key? I don't have a key.

38
00:02:24.829 --> 00:02:28.741
Theo: We can't leave Frankie locked in the trunk!

39
00:02:28.742 --> 00:02:33.286
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!
